  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SADC Transactions Cleared on an Immediate Basis (TCIB) Payment Scheme Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project development objective (PDO) is to support payment system integration efforts in SADC countries. This will be achieved through (i) design, mobilization and deployment of low value credit scheme implemented by SADC member countries to support cross border transfers of remittances, and (ii) data subscription.</narrative>
  </description>
